<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Seat Available: Claim Your Spot - {{eventTitle}}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; margin: 0; padding: 24px; }
    .card { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); }
    .header { background: #16a34a; color: #ffffff; padding: 28px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
    .content { padding: 32px; font-size: 15px; }
    .timer-box { background: #f0fdf4; border: 2px dashed #16a34a; padding: 18px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px; margin: 24px 0; }
    .timer-box h3 { margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: #15803d; font-size: 20px; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #16a34a; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Good News! A Seat Opened Up</h1>
      <p>{{eventTitle}}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hi <strong>{{studentName}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>A confirmed seat is now available for you for <strong>{{eventTitle}}</strong>.</p>
      
      <div class="timer-box">
        <h3>Time Remaining to Claim: {{minutesRemaining}} Minutes</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #166534;">Offer Expiry: <strong>{{formattedExpiry}}</strong></p>
      </div>

      <p>If not claimed within the designated time window, this seat reservation will automatically roll over to the next student in the queue.</p>

      <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 28px;">
        <a href="{{claimUrl}}" class="btn">Claim Your Confirmed Seat Now</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      Eventora Smart Campus Event OS &bull; Automated Waitlist Dispatcher
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
